atlas provider

architecture commerce-observation-provider
  canonical_name CommerceObservationProvider
  family provider
  domain Provider / Commerce observation
  layer materialization
  semantic_question Which declared commerce carriers can resolve a product, observe an offer, price, or availability, and what exact observation shape may each contribute?
  purpose A phenotype catalog, SourceFrontier storefront probe, capability route planner, merchant-expansion compiler and receipt-bound external-commerce materializer. WooCommerce and Shopify public endpoint shapes become eligible storefront channels only after the ordinary observer answers. Retained WooCommerce, Shopify, eBay Browse, Keepa-normalized and Open Prices payloads lower into ProductIdentity, MerchantOffer, PriceObservation and AvailabilityObservation. The provider route never calls an undeclared or unavailable provider.
  maturity implemented
  owns CommerceObservationProvider
  owns StorefrontPhenotype
  publishes ProductIdentity
  publishes MerchantOffer
  publishes PriceObservation
  publishes AvailabilityObservation
  consumes ForeignTwin
  consumes SourceFrontier
  node_types StorefrontPhenotype
  node_types ProductIdentity
  node_types MerchantOffer
  node_types PriceObservation
  node_types AvailabilityObservation
  edge_types fingerprinted_as
  edge_types observed_from
  invariant runtime commerce material is accepted only from a declared phenotype with a retained source receipt; a URL resemblance does not select an adapter
  invariant ProductIdentity aliases are source-supplied coordinates and do not merge merchant variants by title resemblance
  invariant PriceObservation and AvailabilityObservation are separate dated statements over one MerchantOffer; neither is inventory truth, a buyer quote, or a reservation
  invariant a provider declared without a receipt-preserving materializer is refused rather than reduced to a generic page scrape
  invariant discovery and materialization are read-only; no product, merchant, carrier, or provider is contacted for checkout, payment, or account data
  invariant the declared endpoint probe owns its request path, response key and response shape; the observer must return an explicit allow receipt and 2xx HTTP result before any candidate endpoint can become eligible
  forbidden_inference a WooCommerce or Shopify fingerprint -> every path on the merchant being public, stable, or available
  forbidden_inference an observed price -> a price this estate will pay, a merchant quote, a payment, or settlement
  forbidden_inference observed availability -> inventory truth, buyer eligibility, delivery, or a reservation
  forbidden_inference matching SKU, GTIN, ASIN, or title -> an exact cross-merchant product equivalence beyond the aliases a source supplied
  source_path schemas/control/commerce-observation-providers.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/compile_commerce_family.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreSourceFrontier/tools/probe_storefronts.mjs
  source_path schemas/control/commerce-observation-routing.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCMS/content-types/product_identity.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCMS/content-types/merchant_offer.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCMS/content-types/price_observation.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCMS/content-types/availability_observation.json
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/commerce_family.test.mjs
  known_gap Magento, Saleor, BigCommerce, product JSON-LD/sitemaps, affiliate feeds, Sovrn, Rakuten, Best Buy, Etsy, TCGplayer, BrickLink and comparison providers are declared capability families but have no receipt-preserving adapter yet. Credential presence, provider cost, cache freshness and a lawful source receipt must all be supplied to an execution layer before a planned provider route can run.

interaction commerce-observation-provider-extends-marketplace-observation
  source commerce-observation-provider
  destination marketplace-observation
  relation materializes_observed_offer_facets
  preserves a retained source receipt, merchant address, observation time, and the distinction among identity, offer, price, and availability
  drops checkout, quote, reservation, payment, settlement, fulfilment, delivery, and ownership state
  forbidden_inference a lowered MerchantOffer -> a CommerceChain stage beyond the independently observed listing
  forbidden_inference a price or availability row -> a current offer for a particular buyer
  invalidates_on the source receipt, declared phenotype, product payload, or provider materializer changing
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/compile_commerce_family.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/commerce_family.test.mjs

interaction commerce-observation-provider-probes-source-frontier
  source commerce-observation-provider
  destination source-frontier
  relation qualifies_storefront_endpoint
  preserves the exact endpoint answer, ordinary observer/robots boundary, root, endpoint phenotype, and eligible-not-admitted source standing
  drops product materialization, full-catalogue coverage, credentials, merchant authority, buyer eligibility, checkout, payment, and delivery
  forbidden_inference an eligible storefront endpoint -> an admitted source, a retained product, or a public path beyond the answered endpoint
  invalidates_on the endpoint answer, robots decision, observer receipt, or declared phenotype shape changing
  binding cmd/BonfyreSourceFrontier/tools/probe_storefronts.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/commerce_family.test.mjs

interaction commerce-observation-provider-routes-provider-graph
  source commerce-observation-provider
  destination provider-graph
  relation plans_capability_route
  preserves requested capability, declared provider capability, preference order, availability state, and credential wait state
  drops authority to contact, a fresh provider result, product equivalence, provider cost measurement, and every commercial effect
  forbidden_inference a selected route -> a provider call, an observation, or a right to buy
  invalidates_on the routing policy, provider declaration, capability declaration, or supplied availability state changing
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/compile_commerce_family.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/commerce_family.test.mjs
